      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "先祖が掘った深い井戸が涸れちまった……\n占いができる奴が言うには『帝都の美しい踊り手が\n舞を披露すればまた水が湧き出す』って話でさ……\n藁にもすがる気持ちだ。一丁来てくれねえか？",
        "official_en": "The well my ancestors dug has dried up... A guy\nwho tells fortunes said that water will spring up if\na beautiful dancer from the capital performs here.\nCan I ask you to come?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
