        "branch_phase": null,
        "authored_group": "MSQID_Comp_LED_ShowProvince6"
      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "どういう訳だか、あんたの踊りが終わった後で\n地の底が震えて、また水が湧くようになった……！\nいや驚いたね！　あんたも、占いも！　とにかく、\nあんたは村の恩人だ、また遊びに来てくれよ！",
        "official_en": "I don't know how it's possible, but after your dance,\nthe ground shook and water sprang up! I'm shocked!\nAnyway, the village owes you, and we'd love to host\nyou here again.",
        "real_en": null
      },
